      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Jenkins, J. G., &amp; Dallenbach, K. M. (1924). Obliviscence during sleep and waking. The American Journal of Psychology, 35(4), 605‑612. https://doi.org/10.2307/1414040</dct:bibliographicCitation>
