      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Lutz, N. D., Harkotte, M., &amp; Born, J. (in press). Sleep‘s contribution to memory formation. Physiological Reviews. https://doi.org/10.1152/physrev.00054.2024</dct:bibliographicCitation>
