      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Newbury, C. R., Crowley, R., Rastle, K., &amp; Tamminen, J. (2021). Sleep deprivation and memory: Meta-analytic reviews of studies on sleep deprivation before and after learning. Psychological Bulletin, 147(11), 1215–1240. https://doi.org/10.1037/bul0000348</dct:bibliographicCitation>
