      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Pardilla-Delgado, E., &amp; Payne, J. D. (2017). The Deese-Roediger-Mcdermott (DRM) task : A simple cognitive paradigm to investigate false memories in the laboratory. JoVE (Journal of Visualized Experiments), 119, e54793. https://doi.org/10.3791/54793</dct:bibliographicCitation>
