      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Reilly, J., &amp; Kean, J. (2007). Formal distinctiveness of high- and low-imageability nouns : Analyses and theoretical implications. Cognitive Science, 31(1), 157‑168. https://doi.org/10.1080/03640210709336988</dct:bibliographicCitation>
