      <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.loterre.fr/ark:/67375/P66"/>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Anzanello, M., &amp; Fogliatto, F. (2011). Learning curve models and applications: Literature review and research directions. International Journal of Industrial Ergonomics, 41(5), 573–583. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ergon.2011.05.001</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Bills, A. G. (1934). General experimental psychology. Longmans, Green and co.</dct:bibliographicCitation>
