      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Koen, J. D., Barrett, F. S., Harlow, I. M., &amp; Yonelinas, A. P. (2017). The ROC Toolbox: A toolbox for analyzing receiver-operating characteristics derived from confidence ratings. Behavior Research Methods, 49(4), 1399–1406. https://doi.org/10.3758/s13428-016-0796-z</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Riesthuis, P., Otgaar, H., &amp; Bücken, C. (2025). Ready to ROC? A tutorial on simulation-based power analyses for null hypothesis significance, minimum-effect, and equivalence testing for ROC curve analyses. Behavior Research Methods, 57(4), 1–20. https://doi.org/10.3758/s13428-025-02646-x</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Yonelinas, A. P., &amp; Parks, C. M. (2007). Receiver operating characteristics (ROCs) in recognition memory: A review. Psychological Bulletin, 133(5), 800-832. https://doi.org/10.1037/0033-2909.133.5.800</dct:bibliographicCitation>
