      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Hodos, W. (1970). Nonparametric index of response bias for use in detection and recognition experiments. Psychological Bulletin, 74(5), 351‑354. https://doi.org/10.1037/h0029933</dct:bibliographicCitation>
