      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Stanislaw, H., &amp; Todorov, N. (1999). Calculation of signal detection theory measures. Behavior Research Methods, Instruments, &amp; Computers, 31(1), 137‑149. https://doi.org/10.3758/BF03207704</dct:bibliographicCitation>
