      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Stern, Y., Albert, M., Barnes, C. A., Cabeza, R., Pascual-Leone, A., &amp; Rapp, P. R. (2022). A framework for concepts of reserve and resilience in aging. Neurobiology of Aging, 124, 100-103. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neurobiolaging.2022.10.015</dct:bibliographicCitation>
