      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Flavell, J. H. (1971). First discussant’s comments: What is memory development the development of? Human Development, 14(4), 272–278. https://doi.org/10.1159/000271221</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Le Berre, A.-P., Eustache, F., &amp; Beaunieux, H. (2009). La métamémoire : théorie et clinique. Revue de neuropsychologie, 1(4), 312–320. https://doi.org/10.3917/rne.014.0312</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Mazancieux, A., Pereira, M., Faivre, N., Mamassian, P., Moulin, C. J. A., &amp; Souchay, C. (2023). Towards a common conceptual space for metacognition in perception and memory. Nature Reviews Psychology, 2(12), Article 12. https://doi.org/10.1038/s44159-023-00245-1</dct:bibliographicCitation>
