      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Miyashita, T., Kikuchi, E., Horiuchi, J., &amp; Saitoe, M. (2018). Long-term memory engram cells are established by c-Fos/CREB transcriptional cycling. Cell Reports, 25(10), 2716-2728.e3. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.celrep.2018.11.022</dct:bibliographicCitation>
