      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Miry, O., Li, J., &amp; Chen, L. (2021). The quest for the hippocampal memory engram: From theories to experimental evidence. Frontiers in Behavioral Neuroscience, 14. Scopus. https://doi.org/10.3389/fnbeh.2020.632019</dct:bibliographicCitation>
