      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Bolt, T., &amp; Uddin, L. Q. (2025). “the brain is…”: A survey of the brain’s many definitions. Neuroinformatics, 23(1), 4. https://doi.org/10.1007/s12021-024-09699-x</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Houdé, O., Mazoyer, B., &amp; Tzourio-Mazoyer, N. (2010). Cerveau et psychologie. Presses Universitaires de France.</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <skos:broader rdf:resource="http://data.loterre.fr/ark:/67375/P66-C4BRZDKH-W"/>
