      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Poitras, M., Péléja, L., Lavertu, G., Langlois, A., Boulerice, K., Berthelo, P., Vincent-Lamarre, P., Beaulieu, S., Bournival, V., Brault, L., Charlebois, J., Galloway, E. C., Gauthier, A., Gibeau, R.-M., Giroux, N., Jacob, G., La Flèche, M., Laurina, L.-R., Legault, V., … Winder, M. R. (2020). A replication of Waugh and Norman (1965) primary memory study. The Quantitative Methods for Psychology, 16(2), r1–r7. https://doi.org/10.20982/tqmp.16.2.r001</dct:bibliographicCitation>
