      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Geurten, M., Meulemans, T., &amp; Willems, S. (2018). A closer look at children’s metacognitive skills: The case of the distinctiveness heuristic. Journal of Experimental Child Psychology, 172, 130–148. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jecp.2018.03.007</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Lampinen, J. M., &amp; Odegard, T. N. (2006). Memory editing mechanisms. Memory, 14(6), 649–654. https://doi.org/10.1080/09658210600648407</dct:bibliographicCitation>
