      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Maswood, R., Luhmann, C. C., &amp; Rajaram, S. (2021). Persistence of false memories and emergence of collective false memory: Collaborative recall of DRM word lists. Memory, 0(0), 1–15. https://doi.org/10.1080/09658211.2021.1928222</dct:bibliographicCitation>
