      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">test de rappel</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A task during which the subject is asked to retrieve, in their absence, elements stored in memory.</skos:definition>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Tâche durant laquelle le sujet doit récupérer, en leur absence, des éléments stockés en mémoire.</skos:definition>
