      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Kelly, M. O., &amp; Risko, E. F. (2022). Revisiting the influence of offloading memory on free recall. Memory &amp; Cognition, 50(4), 710–721. https://doi.org/10.3758/s13421-021-01237-3</dct:bibliographicCitation>
