      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Geiselman, R. E., Fisher, R. P., Firstenberg, I., Hutton, L. A., Sullivan, S. J., Avetissan, I. V., &amp; Prosk, A. L. (1984). Enhancement of eyewitness memory : An empirical evaluation of the cognitive interview. Journal of Police Science and Administration, 12(1), 74‑80.</dct:bibliographicCitation>
