      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Barzykowski, K., Staugaard, S. R., &amp; Mazzoni, G. (2021). Retrieval effort or intention : Which is more important for participants’ classification of involuntary and voluntary memories? British Journal of Psychology, 112(4), 1080‑1102. https://doi.org/10.1111/bjop.12498</dct:bibliographicCitation>
