      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Orbach, Y., Hershkowitz, I., Lamb, M. E., Sternberg, K. J., Esplin, P. W., &amp; Horowitz, D. (2000). Assessing the value of structured protocols for forensic interviews of alleged child abuse victims. Child Abuse &amp; Neglect, 24(6), 733–752. https://doi.org/10.1016/S0145-2134(00)00137-X</dct:bibliographicCitation>
