      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Yarmey, A. D. (2007). The psychology of speaker identification and earwitness memory. In R. C. L. Lindsay, D. F. Ross, J. D. Read, &amp; M. P. Toglia (Eds.), The Handbook of Eyewitness Psychology: Vol. 2. Memory for people. (pp. 101–136). Lawrence Erlbaum Associates.</dct:bibliographicCitation>
