      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Minaee, S., Mikolov, T., Nikzad, N., Chenaghlu, M., Socher, R., Amatriain, X., &amp; Gao, J. (2024). Large language models: A survey (arXiv:2402.06196). https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2402.06196</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Raiaan, M. A. K., Mukta, Md. S. H., Fatema, K., Fahad, N. M., Sakib, S., Mim, M. M. J., Ahmad, J., Ali, M. E., &amp; Azam, S. (2024). A review on large language models: Architectures, applications, taxonomies, open issues and challenges. IEEE Access, 12, 26839–26874. https://doi.org/10.1109/ACCESS.2024.3365742</dct:bibliographicCitation>
