      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Otgaar, H., Mangiulli, I., Li, C., Jelicic, M., &amp; Muris, P. (2025). The recovery and retraction of memories of abuse: A scoping review. Frontiers in Psychology, 16. https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2025.1498258</dct:bibliographicCitation>
