      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Gureckis, T. M., &amp; Markant, D. B. (2012). Self-Directed Learning: A cognitive and computational perspective. Perspectives on Psychological Science, 7(5), 464–481. https://doi.org/10.1177/1745691612454304</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Kornell, N., &amp; Bjork, R. A. (2007). The promise and perils of self-regulated study. Psychonomic Bulletin &amp; Review, 14(2), 219–224. https://doi.org/10.3758/BF03194055</dct:bibliographicCitation>
