      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Sweeney-Reed, C. M., Buentjen, L., Voges, J., Schmitt, F. C., Zaehle, T., Kam, J. W. Y., Kaufmann, J., Heinze, H.-J., Hinrichs, H., Knight, R. T., &amp; Rugg, M. D. (2021). The role of the anterior nuclei of the thalamus in human memory processing. Neuroscience &amp; Biobehavioral Reviews, 126, 146–158. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neubiorev.2021.02.046</dct:bibliographicCitation>
