      <dct:bibliographicCitation>McQuiston-Surrett, D., Malpass, R. S., &amp; Tredoux, C. G. (2006). Sequential vs simultaneous lineups: A review of methods, data, and theory. Psychology, Public Policy, and Law, 12(2), 137–169. https://doi.org/10.1037/1076-8971.12.2.137</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <inist:isStudyMethodOf rdf:resource="http://data.loterre.fr/ark:/67375/P66-D304PDBZ-3"/>
