      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Frowd, C. D. (2021). Forensic facial composites. In A. M. Smith, M. P. Toglia, &amp; J. M. Lampinen (Eds.), Methods, measures, and theories in eyewitness identification tasks (pp. 34–64). Routledge. https://doi.org/10.4324/9781003138105-5</dct:bibliographicCitation>
