      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Sporer, S. L., Tredoux, C. G., Vredeveldt, A., Kempen, K., &amp; Nortje, A. (2020). Does exposure to facial composites damage eyewitness memory? A comprehensive review. Applied Cognitive Psychology, 34(5), 1166–1179. https://doi.org/10.1002/acp.3705</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Tredoux, C. G., Sporer, S. L., Vredeveldt, A., Kempen, K., &amp; Nortje, A. (2021). Does constructing a facial composite affect eyewitness memory? A research synthesis and meta-analysis. Journal of Experimental Criminology, 17(4), 713–741. https://doi.org/10.1007/s11292-020-09432-z</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Zahradníková, B., Duchovičová, S., &amp; Schreiber, P. (2018). Facial composite systems: Review. Artificial Intelligence Review, 49(1), 1–22. https://doi.org/10.1007/s10462-016-9519-1</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <inist:isStudyMethodOf rdf:resource="http://data.loterre.fr/ark:/67375/P66-D304PDBZ-3"/>
      <skos:broader rdf:resource="http://data.loterre.fr/ark:/67375/P66-D304PDBZ-3"/>
