      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Bennett-Levy, J., &amp; Powell, G. E. (1980). The Subjective Memory Questionnaire (SMQ). An investigation into the self-reporting of ‘real-life’ memory skills. British Journal of Social and Clinical Psychology, 19(2), 177–188. https://doi.org/10.1111/j.2044-8260.1980.tb00946.x</dct:bibliographicCitation>
      <dct:bibliographicCitation>Lucas, J. A., Telch, M. J., &amp; Bigler, E. D. (1991). Memory functioning in panic disorder: A neuropsychological perspective. Journal of Anxiety Disorders, 5(1), 1–20. https://doi.org/10.1016/0887-6185(91)90013-J</dct:bibliographicCitation>
